# External tools installed by `moyue install TOOL' (see bin/commands/tools.el).
# They land in bin/ or in the package cache the rest of .cache already covers,
# and a fresh clone gets them back with `moyue install --tools'.  The Windows
# variants are listed too, so a checkout on that platform stays clean.
